    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so you're saying that letting go is actually the more logical path? that choosing to end the struggle is more \"rational\" than just keeping up this pretend fight against nothingness? it feels like people only call it \"wrong\" because they're afraid of the silence, not because there's an actual reason to stay.",
